    "summary": "## Sprint: cognitive-mcp-cleanup-orchads-migration-20260710 v3.0\n\n### Objetivo\nDescomponer features/ (~22 modulos huerfanos) en 4 Bounded Contexts (agent, tools, workflow, scrum) + shared (frameworks), eliminando duplicacion entre features/ y shared/.\n\n### Resultado final: 11/11 tareas completadas\n\n| DEC | Estado | Descripcion |\n|-----|--------|-------------|\n| DEC-001 | ✅ | Instruction Module en tools/instructions/ |\n| DEC-002 | ✅ | Identity + DK extraidos a agent/ |\n| DEC-003 | ✅ | TaskDecomposition + Proposal a scrum/domain/ |\n| DEC-004 | ✅ | server.py importa desde agent/api/ |\n| DEC-005 | ✅ | decision_schemas + fact_tools a tools/ |\n| DEC-006 | ✅ | CPG movido a features/tools/cpg/ |\n| DEC-007 | ✅ | AutoFacts movido a tools/events/git_diff_handler.py |\n| DEC-008 | ✅ | write_enforcement + tracing a workflow/. trust_gate creado |\n| DEC-009 | ✅ | shared/kv/ framework. Legacy eliminado |\n| DEC-010 | ✅ | 20 modulos migrados de features/ a los 4 BCs |\n| DEC-011 | ✅ | ops_init.py refactorizado cyclo 70 -> <10 |\n\n### Metricas clave\n\n| Indicador | Antes | Despues |\n|-----------|-------|---------|\n| features/ | 22 directorios | 5 (agent, tools, workflow, scrum, shared) |\n| shared/ | ~80 items | ~15 (solo frameworks) |\n| session.py | 3699 lineas | 0 (migrado a agent/session/) |\n| ops_init.py cyclo | 70 | <10 por funcion |\n| Net code change | -- | -7,030 lineas |\n\n### Arquitectura final\n\nfeatures/\n  agent/   (242) - Sesion, decisiones, acl, mensajes, guidance, workspace, trust, memora, navegacion\n  tools/   (126) - CPG, meta, reason, metadata, instructions, events\n  workflow/ (61) - Gates, tracing, persistence, dispatch, ops_metrics\n  scrum/    (49) - Project, git, task_decomposition, sprint_service\n  shared/   (6)  - Event bus\n\nshared/ (top-level, frameworks)\n  cqrs/ - Framework CQRS\n  kv/   - Framework KV\n  protocol/ - Protocolo\n  helpers/ - Capa de compatibilidad\n  config.py, logger.py, registry.py, ops_init.py\n\n### Modulos migrados\n\nA agent/: session, decisions, acl, messages, guidance, workspace, trust, memora, navigation, project_preferences, engine, identity, DK, policies, calibration, context\nA tools/: cpg, meta, reason, metadata, auto_facts\nA workflow/: write_enforcement, tracing, persistence, dispatch, gates, monitoring (ops)\nA scrum/: project, git\nA shared/: cqrs, kv, anti_corruption\n"
